# Good Flow spike · case (c) Map, real events (the trial's rhythm): pans with holds, pinches in and out (magnify gestures
# with phases), flicks with momentum (the Map's coast), ≥ 15 s of input; then the rest row (10 s: 0 ticks).
rest       wait 6000
map-pan    trackpad 850,500 3 hold wobble
map-pinch  pinch 850,500 0.8 480 4
map-pinch  pinch 850,500 -0.45 480 4
map-pan    trackpad 850,500 3 wobble
map-flick  flick 850,500 -40
map-flick  flick 850,500 40
map-pinch  pinch 850,500 0.6 480 4
map-pinch  pinch 850,500 -0.4 480 4
map-pan    trackpad 850,500 4 hold wobble
rest-after wait 10500
